Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 00:15:28 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1032/1178] Saved styles and profiles, a Speech profile up to
 15:00, and the 1.6 guidance that really goes out

- Library on Forge (lab: yue2_os/presets.json): styles by name under the Style field; profiles
  (every knob but the texts and seeds, written out in full) beside the planning mode. Built in:
  Music up to 8:00 (the defaults) and Speech up to 15:00 (Direct, 900 s, a music budget of
  22500 tokens).
- Engine: a budget that does not fit beside the prefix is cut to what does, with a line in the
  log, instead of a FATAL; only a prefix that leaves no room fails. A long reading gets what the
  24576 context holds and is marked truncated if it runs into the cut.
- 1031 left the guidance field filling itself with 1.0 / 1.01, so an untouched field went out
  as an explicit 1.0 and the new default never ran. It fills with the engine default now.
- ?scope=NAME in the page address keeps settings and presets in separate files: a test page
  never writes into the ones a working browser keeps.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
